rule: RR11 — 레거시 문자열 ast 셀을 되돌려 보낸 TABLE 저장은 성공하고 객체 ast 로 저장된다
file: src/backend/mdm/lib/src/main/java/com/dongkuk/dmes/mdm/common/rule/RuleCellsCodec.java
test: cd src/backend && JAVA_HOME=/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home ./gradlew :mdm:api:test --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dme.ruleEdit.RuleTableServiceTest" --console=plain
e2e: no
--- find
    private static Map<String, Object> decodeAstString(String s, String errorMessage) {
        Object decoded;
        try {
            decoded = MAPPER.readValue(s, Object.class);
        } catch (JsonProcessingException | IllegalArgumentException e) {
            throw invalid(errorMessage);
        }
        if (!(decoded instanceof Map<?, ?> map)) {
            throw invalid(errorMessage);
        }
        @SuppressWarnings("unchecked")
        Map<String, Object> typed = (Map<String, Object>) map;
        return typed;
    }
--- replace
    private static Map<String, Object> decodeAstString(String s, String errorMessage) {
        throw invalid(errorMessage);
    }
